            "notes": "POWER = [Pulsar Plus](item_4795ae1f-580d-47ec-a01d-0933cba56212)\n\nITEMS =\n\nI prefer using [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) over [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) for the shields and +life regen, but feel free to use [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) if you'd prefer! Though I typically stick with [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) as I buy [Lock-On Shield](item_220287f8-1dc5-4a6c-9e86-c14cf970b689) round 2.\n\nThen I use [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418), using topedo for damage+gun to finish people off. \n\nIf you'd prefer to focus torpedo use [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7) instead.\n\nBoth options generate a good amount of cash!\n\n>TOTAL HP = 257\n>\n>SHIELD = 175\n>\n>WEAPON = 5%\n>\n>ABILITY = 10%\n>\n>COOLDOWN = 0%\n>\n>LIFESTEAL = 0%",
